Quest</a>. After delivering four <a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20a%20Broken%20Amulet\">broken amulet pieces</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a>, you can collect this amulet from him after a 24-hour (real-time) wait. You must use it on <a href=\"#/wiki/Koshei%20the%20Deathless\">Koshei</a>'s dead body in order to defeat him, but you can also just sell it for the same price as or sometimes even higher than the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Legs\">Blue Legs</a>, the reward of the quest, to other players.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Amulets and Necklaces</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Legs\">Blue Legs</a></li><li>Death Damage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Priest%20Shargon\">Death Priest Shargon</a></li><li>Death Resistant</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragon</a></li><li>Guide:Moneymaking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hatebreeder\">Hatebreeder</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Koshei%20th